{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49369","headline":"醉花间 一 · 毛文锡","name":"醉花间 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休相问，怕相问，相问还添恨。\n春水满塘生，鸂鶒还相趂。\n昨夜雨霏霏，临明寒一阵。\n偏忆戍楼人，久绝边庭信。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}